        "indent_content": false,
        "title": "Welcome to Umbra Ceramics",
        "subtitle": "",
        "text": "<p>This website,&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.umbra-ceramics.com/\">www.umbra-ceramics.com</a>, is a space where I share and sell my handmade ceramic work, as well as, from time to time, offer pottery workshops in Luxembourg.</p><p>These Terms & Conditions explain how the website works and the conditions that apply when purchasing a piece or booking a workshop. By using this website or placing an order, you agree to these Terms & Conditions. Please take a moment to read them before making a purchase.</p><p>If you have any questions, you can always get in touch at&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:info@umbra-ceramics.com\">info@umbra-ceramics.com</a>.</p>",
        "btntext": "",
        "btnlink": ""
      }
    },
    "beconcept_numbered_text_jexnCD": {
      "type": "beconcept-numbered-text",
